  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Triple Core — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>At 6th level, you have learned to specialize in one of your forms, allowing it to become semi-permanent. Choose one of your core options you have access to and gain its upgraded option:</p>\n<p><strong>Unblockable Blows.</strong> Your strikes are imbued with unblockable power. Once per turn when you miss with a melee attack, you still deal damage equal to your Strength or Dexterity modifier.<br />\n<strong>Energy Blast.</strong> Your cursed energy has become far more destructive. Once per turn when you deal damage with a ranged cursed energy attack, you add your Cursed Energy modifier to the damage roll. If you already add your modifier to the roll, you add it a second time.<br />\n<strong>Defensive Form.</strong> Your body passively reinforces itself with cursed energy. When you take damage, you can use your reaction to reduce the damage by your Cursed Energy modifier + your proficiency bonus.<br />\n<strong>Divebomb.</strong> Your body has adapted to improve its swiftness. You can spend 1 ce to take the dash, disengage, or dodge action as a bonus action.</p>\n<p>Your upgraded options are always active even when you haven’t entered a core form. Though you can not benefit from an upgraded option while in a different core option’s form. You can gain an additional upgraded option at 11th and 18th level.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
